  What to do: a guard that threw out a case whose worker was at its cap is
  worth doubting before the pipeline is. Run `prove.py ceiling` to find out
  whether the thing a guard blamed actually moves the rate, and `prove.py
  probe` to find out whether this machine can do the step at all. Both are
  minutes, and neither changes the pipeline.

